{
  "id": "b20_ms04",
  "title": "Angsana Hujung Lorong",
  "title_source": "scripted",
  "genre": "Malay lullaby-pop (dodoi-style 6/8 night song)",
  "language": "ms",
  "language_name": "Malay (Malaysia)",
  "mood": "wry, gentle, tender",
  "persona": "",
  "subject": "Every night Hazwan walks Najwa home past the old angsana tree at the end of her lorong said to hold a pontianak, insisting it is to protect her; she hums so he thinks she is brave while his sweating hand grips hers, and one night she turns round and walks him home instead.",
  "caption": "Malay lullaby-pop in the dodoi night-song tradition, slow rocking 6/8. A celesta playing a music-box melody, a fingerpicked nylon-string guitar rocking in arpeggios, a soft upright bass on the downbeats, a brushed snare tapping gently, and a warm cello pad swelling under the chorus. Warm intimate chamber mix, celesta and guitar forward, short room reverb. Female warm mid-low alto singing a steady, unhurried melody. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 66 BPM, F major. Wry, gentle and tender. No rap, no autotune, no trap hi-hats, no EDM drop, no dangdut, no drum kit groove, no big pop chorus.",
  "lyrics": "[Intro - celesta, nylon guitar rocking in 6/8]\n[Verse 1]\nTiap malam abang hantar aku balik\nLorong panjang, lampu satu-satu\nDi hujung lorong ada pokok angsana\nOrang kata pontianak tinggal situ\n[Pre-Chorus]\nAbang kata, takut aku sorang-sorang\nTapi langkah abang makin laju\n[Chorus]\nAbang, jalan perlahan\nAku tak takut, aku tahu\nTangan abang sejuk berpeluh\nAku pegang, kita lalu\n[Verse 2]\nAku sengaja bersenandung\nBiar abang sangka aku berani\nDaun gugur, abang terloncat\nAku buat-buat tak nampak\n[Pre-Chorus]\nMalam ni aku berhenti kat pagar\nJom abang, aku hantar abang pula\n[Chorus]\nAbang, jalan perlahan\nGiliran aku jaga abang\nTangan aku hangat saja\nKita lalu, pokok pun diam\n[Bridge - celesta alone, then cello]\nPontianak pun mungkin tersenyum\n[Chorus]\nAbang, jalan perlahan\nAku hantar sampai depan pintu\nTangan abang dah kering\nEsok malam abang hantar lagi\n[Outro - celesta, guitar fading]\nPokok angsana, tolong diam",
